<LegalPage title="Terms and conditions" description="Terms for booking a taxi, tour or transfer with JC Cabs.">
  <h2>Bookings</h2>
  <p>
    A booking is confirmed when JC Cabs confirms it by phone or WhatsApp. Please give accurate pickup, drop, date,
    time and passenger details.
  </p>

  <h2>Fares and charges</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Fares are based on the vehicle and the distance or package, as shown on the Fleet &amp; fares page.</li>
    <li>Driver bata, toll, parking, night and waiting charges are listed in the fare notes on the Fleet &amp; Fares page.</li>
    <li>Fares are confirmed before the trip starts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Passengers</h2>
  <p>
    The number of passengers and bags must fit the vehicle booked. Smoking, damage to the vehicle and anything
    unlawful are not permitted. Additional rules: TBD.
  </p>

  <h2>Delays and liability</h2>
  <p>JC Cabs's responsibility for delays, changes and loss of belongings: TBD.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms: use the details on the Contact page.</p>
</LegalPage>
